Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:36.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它会告诉你选择合适的事物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It realigns your thinking to pick healthy food.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.37,0:18:39.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你熟睡的时候慢慢向你灌输\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whispers you into it while you sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.67,0:18:43.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来不错  我该试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I should try that, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.52,0:18:52.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很喜欢你那天唱的歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I liked your singing the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.12,0:18:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个时候唱歌就不会有人听到我在尿尿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was trying to sing so no-one could hear me pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.03,0:19:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又不是塞尔玛那样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not Selma or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的嗓音真的很不错  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got a phenomenal voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.10,0:19:04.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我听过最美妙的歌...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the most beautiful song...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你...  是不是觉得我有点笨手笨脚的?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Y... You think I'm being cheesy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.36,0:19:14.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的确有点蹩脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I am being cheesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你唱的真的很好...  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it was beautiful, so, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.48,0:19:21.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现实有时候并没有那么精致  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reality's cheesy sometimes. Not often,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.19,0:19:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不得不承认...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}admittedly, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:24.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如说现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.68,0:19:27.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是...  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.04,0:19:35.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.63,0:19:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只不过是随便一哼吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just noises, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.00,0:19:43.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有节奏的随便一哼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noises in the right order.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.57,0:19:44.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别谦虚了  你唱的真的很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dont downplay... you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:47.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那歌倒是不错  很多年前的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The song's good. It's old.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.84,0:19:53.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈以前经常唱  她是从她妈妈那里学来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mum used to sing it and she learnt it from her mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.11,0:19:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我也从妈妈那里学来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hand-me-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.64,0:20:00.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没有想过去达人秀试试?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thought of trying out for Hot Shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.59,0:20:04.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我么?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.45,0:20:07.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么不?  - 在评委面前唱歌?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why not? -  Singing in front of Judge Hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.36,0:20:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是杀了我吧  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd die! Seriously,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.36,0:20:10.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下辈子能去合唱团都算不错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be halfway to the afterlife come the chorus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.96,0:20:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你比那优秀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you'd walk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:13.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先  我不会去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A, I wouldnt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再说我也没有那么多的里程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And B... I dont have that clockage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光入场券都要一千二百万的里程吧?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's, what, 12 mil just to enter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.88,0:20:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样骑多长时间?  不吃不喝六个月?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of bike time is that? Six months?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.12,0:20:25.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是那么多  但...  - 我现在仅仅够糊口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, but... -  I'm hand to mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.44,0:20:29.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道他们为了上那个舞台省吃俭用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know people save and stuff to get onto that stage
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:32.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塞尔玛就是这样做的  但是你知道么?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then there's what Selma did. But, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:33.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是不会那样...  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather not give myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:35.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道  所以我会送你入场券的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but I'll gift it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部一千二百万  我都会给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The full 12, I'll gift it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.53,0:20:47.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dont be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.03,0:20:49.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是认真的  我富余着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously, I've got it spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.28,0:20:52.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能多出来一千二百万?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got 12 mil spare?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:54.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哥哥留给我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brother left it me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.12,0:20:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是开电视台的?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Own a channel, does he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.31,0:20:58.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不是...  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.08,0:21:00.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He died.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.27,0:21:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他去年去世了...  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He... He died last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后这些里程都转移给了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so it got transferred to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:10.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚好比六个月的里程多  我保留了下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just over six months' worth, but I've kept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.98,0:21:15.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你为什么不自己使用呢?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why dont you spend it on you, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.26,0:21:18.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,买什么?  买那么多鞋给谁穿?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And buy what? Some new shoes for my doppel to wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.38,0:21:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就升级一下你的MOS...  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dont know, upgrade your MOS...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.04,0:21:24.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者吃个半死?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or get a Fat Attack season pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.09,0:21:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就买个服务墙吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buy one of those wall buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.92,0:21:30.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种关闭后可以陪你聊天帮你解决问题的新款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The new ones that talk to you after shutting and solve your problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.36,0:21:32.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就想神一样引导你的梦境  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They guide your dreams, like gurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.53,0:21:34.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们能做的真的很神奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's amazing, really, what they can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.36,0:21:37.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再加一个镜子进来?  然后让我看起来多么可怜?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mirror plug-in? That shows me how I look as a werewolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.31,0:21:38.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这还能干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.15,0:21:41.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 的确有点可怜  - 那些只是东西  它们...  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know it can be quite funny. -  It's all just stuff. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.60,0:21:45.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只是东西  只是一些花俏的东西...  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's stuff, it's confetti, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.16,0:21:49.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的歌声才是真是存在的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got something real.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.76,0:21:53.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有比这更好的去处么?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What better to spend it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.68,0:21:55.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也只是在厕所听到我唱歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard me singing in a toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.13,0:21:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得那很真实?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that real?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.44,0:22:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比这一年中发生的所有事情都真实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More than anything that's happened all year.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.01,0:22:07.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能接受那样贵重的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cant take that kind of clockage off someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.83,0:22:10.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可是一千两百万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's 12 mils, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.20,0:22:12.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我自愿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.93,0:22:18.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看看周围...  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I look around here, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.10,0:22:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是希望有什么真实的事情发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want something real to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.94,0:22:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕只有一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.29,0:22:30.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会弄砸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd mess up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.60,0:22:32.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会的  再说我也不介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldnt. I dont care anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.24,0:22:36.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会陪你一起去  我会要求你去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go with you. I'll be able to force you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.54,0:22:38.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会强迫你去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll force you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.16,0:22:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是明天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's tomorrow.
