Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.51,0:22:52.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快说行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.48,0:22:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我只好说"好"了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go as far as to say, "OK."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.84,0:23:02.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也可以接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which proves acceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:06.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太感谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God for that.
