Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:14.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You loon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.92,0:23:17.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个也可以接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can live with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.56,0:23:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然愿意浪费了那一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd love to fucking ruin that and all.
