Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.99,0:25:23.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱斯·宝贝的最新进展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hottest girls in the nastiest situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.35,0:25:25.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样!  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
