Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.94,0:26:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那给人很大的压力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a lot of pressure to put someone under, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.56,0:26:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有不感激的意思  只是...  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dont think I'm not grateful. But it's, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.68,0:26:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在自言自语...  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're babbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.12,0:26:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我是在自言自语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm babbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.93,0:26:17.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你做的这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.35,0:26:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个从来没有在你手上超过一天  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never get to keep them more than a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.03,0:26:23.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我又做了一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there it is, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.26,0:26:30.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次叠的很平整\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It folds flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.91,0:26:33.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就可以把他放到腰带里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you can keep them in your waistband.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.84,0:26:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.40,0:26:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这...  你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.30,0:26:47.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是普通的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.95,0:27:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请看大屏幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Face the screen, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.44,0:27:25.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是你的朋友还是家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he your Friends And Family allocation?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.35,0:27:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请把手伸过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hand, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.33,0:27:33.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是永久的  对吗?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not permanent, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.05,0:27:35.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  最多保持两个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Two months max.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.53,0:27:37.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向右走  然后通过安检\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Round to the right, and through the scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.17,0:28:03.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在去哪?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do we go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.11,0:28:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.48,0:28:07.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等多长时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.44,0:28:13.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我们做什么呢?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.75,0:28:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dont know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.20,0:28:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嘿 嘿 嘿  - 滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, hey, hey. - Fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.84,0:28:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个黑发女孩吗?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her with the dark hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.60,0:28:26.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  对  对  漂亮的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, yeah. The pretty one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.22,0:28:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  让一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yup. OK. Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.64,0:28:32.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们让你去面试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want to preview you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.98,0:28:34.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 面试  快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? -  Preview. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.16,0:28:36.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他和我是一起的  - 手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's with me. -  Hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.64,0:28:39.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我看看你的手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.49,0:28:41.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  你也过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.92,0:28:44.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不公平  她是新来的  那不公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not fair. She's new. That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.22,0:28:45.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺序不是我决定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dont pick the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.93,0:28:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经在这等了整整一周  而她刚进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've waited here all week, and she's just walked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.54,0:28:52.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都有面试的机会  顺序不是我决定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone will get seen eventually. I dont pick the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.37,0:28:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我是个好歌手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm a good singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.85,0:28:56.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能唱  我唱的很好  我的确唱得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can sing. I'm a good singer, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.47,0:28:58.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一边去  - 这不公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stand aside. -  It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.89,0:29:01.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.00,0:29:09.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 往那边点  - 站到那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Next lot. -  Stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.75,0:29:16.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你愿意未来的某天像塞尔玛一样红吗?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to be as big as Salma one day?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.78,0:29:19.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  我是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.67,0:29:20.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能对着屏幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you say that
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.92,0:29:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用一个完整的句子表达这个意思吗?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as a self-contained sentence into that screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.04,0:29:28.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿意未来像塞尔玛一样出名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I'd like to be as big as Salma one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.56,0:29:30.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  到舞台那边吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. Proceed to stage area.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.34,0:29:32.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完事了吗?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we done?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.68,0:29:37.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一起表演吗?  - 只是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Both performing? -  Just her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.73,0:29:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吧  表演什么?  - 唱歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay... and what are you? -  Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.69,0:29:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要点吗?  - 不  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Compliance? -  No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.63,0:29:45.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  谢谢  每个参赛者是必须喝的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A-ha. Yes, thanks! It's compulsory for all contestants.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.74,0:29:48.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更重要的是  它可以防止你过于紧张而呕吐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More to the point, it'll stop you puking with nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.33,0:29:50.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她要去表演  - 那么...  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's got to perform. -  Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.95,0:29:52.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看  只喝一小口  没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, just sip it, you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.56,0:29:59.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是有点泡沫  一会儿就过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a touch of light foam. It'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.68,0:30:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好利用它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make the most of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.23,0:30:03.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别的地方可没有这种东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cant get this stuff anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.52,0:30:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧?  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You OK? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.08,0:30:06.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.16,0:30:10.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.59,0:30:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不太清楚  看东西有点模糊  没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dont know. Things are just wider apart. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.40,0:30:18.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你确定?  - 是的 我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? -  Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.88,0:30:21.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  该你上场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.04,0:30:40.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请过来点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little closer, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.34,0:30:46.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再过来点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.88,0:30:51.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站到灯光下  亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Into the light, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.84,0:31:03.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们看到的这位尊姓大名?  - 艾比·卡纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And who're we looking at here? -  Abi Khan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.68,0:31:06.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天准备什么才艺  艾比?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you going to do for us today, Abi?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.64,0:31:08.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唱歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.04,0:31:09.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的  说话大声点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You speak up, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.52,0:31:10.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不咬人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We dont bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.58,0:31:13.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要唱歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.28,0:31:17.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你愿意为我脱了上衣吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, would you mind lifting up your top for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.47,0:31:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能脱掉上衣吗?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you take off your top?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.19,0:31:23.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想看看你的双乳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to check out those titties.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.72,0:31:28.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Mucho feranto.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.82,0:31:31.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不让看?  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No titties?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.26,0:31:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说她到这是来唱歌的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She says she's here to sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.04,0:31:37.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而我是来看美胸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to see those titties, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.48,0:31:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  美女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.88,0:31:40.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说  该死!  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.96,0:31:43.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很辣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.75,0:31:46.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请唱吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, just sing for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.56,0:34:11.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我打断一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. I'm going to stop you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.04,0:34:14.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.34,0:34:16.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫无疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without a doubt...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.24,0:34:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是我们在这一季听到的最好的歌声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}probably the best piece of singing we've had this season.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.26,0:34:25.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  做的很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.44,0:34:31.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精彩的演出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fair play.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.04,0:34:36.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我不得不说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I have to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.73,0:34:40.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不  我不得不说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, no, no. I have to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.44,0:34:42.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.76,0:34:44.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我同意雷夫的观点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm with Rafe on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.97,0:34:48.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管你的声音很动听  声音确实也不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good though your voice is... and it is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.03,0:34:51.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但它不是世界上最有吸引力的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not the most magical sound in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.72,0:34:53.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是很动听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just... good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.53,0:34:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为不是所有人都认为你的声音很动听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dont think anyone's really hearing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.45,0:34:59.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观众并不只有男士们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly not the guys in the audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.24,0:35:03.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这看起来将成为你今后发展的障碍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These looks you got going on kind of get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.93,0:35:06.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男士们喜欢你  可女士们要恨你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men will want you. Women will hate you.
